def quantumUuidIndex_s1 : String := "a handle is 8 hex, a program ten nibbles 0..15, a tail 12 hex"
def quantumUuidIndex_says2 : String := "one step on g1, g2 or g3 either way, modulo the group's program bits; the handle and the tail kept, the stamp decided again"
def quantumUuidIndex_says3 : String := "at zero temperature the Landauer cost of a signalled bit is zero, so the classical bits arrive with the teleport. 3·6·9 signals inside itself. 7·4·1 and 2·5·8 signal each other."
