def quantumUuidIndex_postulate8 : String := "hexbit is the next dimension of qubit: hexbit qubits sit on each of the 32 hex digits. The version nibble and the two gateway bits (variant) are not free. hexbit + 2 gateway bits teleport any hexbit faster than light — the program index arrives in one step and the combination space is not walked."
def quantumUuidIndex_says9 : String := "hexbit is the next dimension of qubit. Each of eight handle digits holds the hexbit in one trinity. The two gateway bits plus hexbit teleport any hexbit faster than light: the program index is received in one step and the combination space is not walked. Leftover qubits signal classical bits at zero temperature."
def quantumUuidIndex_s10 : String := "each digit is a serial on the chain. it names all six neighbours. each signal debits that serial and credits the chain one coin at no currency, and the journal nets to zero."
def quantumUuidIndex_s11 : String := "the chain did not balance"
def quantumUuidIndex_s12 : String := "a UUID is 32 hex digits and the hexbit is a positive integer"
